    "Loads settings from ~/.config/ghostty/config. Key bindings are not applied because Limpid manages its own shortcuts. Limpid also takes priority for some safety and display settings. Restart Limpid after editing the file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loads settings from ~/.config/ghostty/config. Key bindings are not applied because Limpid manages its own shortcuts. Limpid also takes priority for some safety and display settings. Restart Limpid after editing the file."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "~/.config/ghostty/config の設定を読み込みます。ただし、キー割り当ては Limpid 側で管理しているため反映されません。また、安全性や表示に関わる一部の設定は Limpid の設定が優先されます。ファイルを編集した後は Limpid を再起動してください。"
          }
        }
      }
