    "Review comments could not be saved. Keep Review open and try the change again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review comments could not be saved. Keep Review open and try the change again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レビューコメントを保存できませんでした。レビューを閉じずに、もう一度操作してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review writes this above the comments it hands to an agent. Leave it empty for the text shown here, which follows the app's language.\n\nThe worktree and the comment count are written above this text, and the comments themselves below it; none of that can be edited here. Rules that belong to the project rather than to this handoff — how to run the tests, whether to commit — go in the agent's own project instructions.\n\nReview pastes into the pane below it, so Limpid keeps Ghostty's paste protection on for every pane: a multi-line paste into a program that did not ask for bracketed paste is confirmed first. This overrides that one setting in your own Ghostty config.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review writes this above the comments it hands to an agent. Leave it empty for the text shown here, which follows the app's language.\n\nThe worktree and the comment count are written above this text, and the comments themselves below it; none of that can be edited here. Rules that belong to the project rather than to this handoff — how to run the tests, whether to commit — go in the agent's own project instructions.\n\nReview pastes into the pane below it, so Limpid keeps Ghostty's paste protection on for every pane: a multi-line paste into a program that did not ask for bracketed paste is confirmed first. This overrides that one setting in your own Ghostty config."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レビューを挿入するとき、コメントの前に置かれる文章です。空のままにすると、ここに表示されている既定の文章が使われます。既定の文章はアプリの表示言語に従います。\n\n作業ツリーとコメント件数はこの文章の上に、コメント本体は下に書き出されます。いずれもここでは編集できません。テストの実行方法やコミットの可否など、この受け渡しではなくプロジェクトに属する規則は、エージェント側のプロジェクト指示に記載します。\n\nレビューは下のペインへ貼り付けるため、Limpid は Ghostty の貼り付け保護を全ペインで有効に保ちます。ブラケットペーストを要求しないプログラムへの複数行の貼り付けは、先に確認を求められます。この 1 項目だけは、あなた自身の Ghostty 設定より優先されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Root": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Root"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ルート"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs `git worktree remove`. The folder is removed from disk.\n\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`git worktree remove` を実行します。フォルダはディスクから削除されます。\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved review comments could not be loaded. This review starts empty.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved review comments could not be loaded. This review starts empty."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
